message: If you use evalkit in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "evalkit: evals as code for LLM apps and agents"
type: software
authors:
  - name: superintelligenceco contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/superintelligenceco/evalkit
url: https://superintelligenceco.github.io/evalkit/
abstract: >-
  evalkit runs YAML eval suites against LLMs or your own app, grades the output with
  deterministic, Python, and LLM-as-judge graders, and gates CI on pass rate and regressions.
keywords:
  - llm
  - evals
  - evaluation
  - testing
  - ci
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
